  "details": "Description\n\nMy left hand will, at random, turn to the \"peace\" sign gesture without my input. It is highly annoying and inconvenient, and there is no specific cause. This problem only appears in VRChat, and on no other program.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nUse a Quest 3 controller, it will start to act up regardless of matienance done on the controller. The right controller is not effected whatsoever. No known workarounds.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-03_10-43-38.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_3a591258-e0e9-4eeb-ae1c-1e19398ba38f/1/file)",
